<title>HONG KONG: Total Access revolver to refinance debt.</title>
<headline>Total Access revolver to refinance debt.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Proceeds from Total Access Communication's US$200 million revolving credit facility will be used primarily to refinance existing debt, arranger Union Bank of Switzerland said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The drawing initially will be used to refinance existing indebtedness of the company,&quot; said Richard Howell, vice president, syndications at UBS.</p>
<p>UBS announced earlier today that Total Access had mandated it to arrange the 364-day revolving credit facility.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
